  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/163054137-8bdde290-e939-4f6a-a788-4842866cb1bf.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1344\" height=\"50\"></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\">此擴充套件為 <a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-integrations\" rel=\"nofollow\">Loot Integrations</a> 的模組，旨在強化以下 <a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/aureljz/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aureljz</a> 所設計的結構中的戰利品：<br></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/when-dungeons-arise\" rel=\"nofollow\">當地下城崛起</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/when-dungeons-arise-seven-seas\" rel=\"nofollow\">當地下城崛起 - 七大洋</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/underground-bunkers\" rel=\"nofollow\">地下掩體</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hellish-trials\" rel=\"nofollow\">地獄試煉與密室</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yeehaw-towns\" rel=\"nofollow\">耶霍小鎮！</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether-villages\" rel=\"nofollow\">天空村莊</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/towers-of-the-wild-additions\" rel=\"nofollow\">荒野之塔：附加內容</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/when-dungeons-arise-lost-architects\" rel=\"nofollow\">當地下城崛起 - 失落的建築師</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simply-houses\" rel=\"nofollow\">簡易房屋</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/twilight-treehouses\" rel=\"nofollow\">暮光樹屋</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/abandoned-camps\" rel=\"nofollow\">廢棄營地</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">戰利品的變異性更高，並從相近的原版戰利品表中隨機抽取，同時亦包含模組戰利品，以確保與所有新增戰利品的模組相容。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">僅需安裝於伺服器端，客戶端無需安裝所有相關模組。<br></span><img style=\"font-size:18px\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/163059508-bfcdb9fc-5f49-4204-afff-d9ae9460beda.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1344\" height=\"50\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">目前已知無任何不相容問題，應能與其他模組順利共存。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
